msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:2299
msgid ""
"Tensor intrinsics transfer data between global memory and LDS using a tensor "
"descriptor. Despite the absence of ``.async`` in their names, these "
"intrinsics are asynchronous. See :ref:`amdgpu-dma-operations` for full "
"documentation."
