#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:4579
msgid ""
"``return_address_register`` is ``PC_32`` for 32-bit processes and ``PC_64`` "
"for 64-bit processes defined in :ref:`amdgpu-dwarf-register-identifier`."
