"GFX90A-CDNA2]_, [AMD-GCN-GFX942-CDNA3]_, [AMD-GCN-GFX10-RDNA1]_, [AMD-GCN-"
"GFX10-RDNA2]_, [AMD-GCN-GFX11-RDNA3]_, [AMD-GCN-GFX11-RDNA3.5]_ and [AMD-GCN-"
"GFX12-RDNA4]_."
